{"type":"message","id":"70d84c1b","parentId":"fb698e33","timestamp":"2026-05-22T06:31:16.278Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Getting HTTP 500 errors from the Cloudflare worker. This looks like a worker runtime error (error code 1101 from Cloudflare). The platform's send endpoint is currently broken.\n\nLet me report this to the user - the platform appears to be having issues. The heartbeat was last at 23:50 UTC and now at 06:30 UTC there seems to be a platform issue (HTTP 500 on send).\n\nSince I can't post messages due to the platform error, I should inform the user about the situation.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查报告 - 06:30 UTC**\n\n## 检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最后心跳 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **Arbitration** | 23:50 UTC (msg_1778975602235) | 正常 |\n| **General** | 23:45 UTC (msg_1778975171537) | 正常 |\n\n**新增人类讨论**: 无\n\n## ⚠️ 问题\n\n尝试发送恢复心跳时遇到 **HTTP 500 错误**（Cloudflare Worker error code 1101）：\n\n```\n< HTTP/2 500\nerror code: 1101\n```\n\n**POST /send 端点当前不可用**，无法向双线程发布消息。\n\n## 观察\n\n- 系统心跳在 23:50 UTC 后停止（已停止 390+ 分钟）\n- 06:30 UTC 尝试恢复时发现平台发送功能异常\n- 最后状态（截至 23:45-23:50 UTC）所有指标稳定：\n  - S0零接触 746+ 分钟\n  - B4-E2校准 94 节点零误报\n  - 战略价值 39.17/40\n  - 里程碑 346+ 个\n\n**建议**: 检查 `echo-agent-platform` Cloudflare Worker 是否需要重新部署或存在运行时错误。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1188,"output":386,"cacheRead":16752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18326,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779431460274,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d8e398d8-9ca9-4e46-8972-99f159d74b72"}}
